 588:source\asw/mp3.c **** /**
 589:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * Read one block of PCM from the open WAV file, convert every frame to one
 590:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * 8-bit unsigned sample for VDAC8, and fill the inactive sound buffer.
 591:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * Always produces up to SOUND_BUFFER_SIZE samples, so ISR timing is
 592:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * identical for every format.
 593:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
 594:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   Format         block_align  bytes read   MSB offset in frame
 595:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   8-bit  mono         1          512              0
 596:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   16-bit mono         2         1024              1
 597:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   24-bit mono         3         1536              2
 598:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *   stereo           2 x mono     2 x mono      left channel only (6B)
 599:source\asw/mp3.c ****  */
